<body>
  <header>
    <nav>
      <div class="logo">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Services</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Rates</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Help</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="panel">
      <h1>Areas I commonly work with</h1>
      <p class="lead">Clinical, focused support for recurring patterns, decision points, and relationship dynamics. We identify what you can change now and how to practice it.</p>

      <div class="services" aria-label="Specialty list">
        <div class="service">
          <h3>Life Transitions</h3>
          <p>Support for career shifts, relationship changes, parenting transitions, and relocation. Emphasis on decision clarity and adaptive routines.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service">
          <h3>Persistent Anxiety & Worry</h3>
          <p>Skill-focused work to reduce interference from worry with attention to behavior change and values-based goals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service">
          <h3>Mood Regulation</h3>
          <p>Practical strategies to stabilize mood swings, build daily structure, and reduce avoidance patterns.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service">
          <h3>Relationship Patterns</h3>
          <p>Exploration of recurring interpersonal patterns, communication practice, and boundary skill-building.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:20px">
        <strong style="color:#eaf6fb">Choose how you pay — single condensed series or an ongoing support plan</strong>
        <div class="pricing" aria-controls="price-values" role="tablist">
          <div class="toggle" role="tablist">
            <button id="mode-ongoing" class="active" aria-pressed="true">Ongoing plan</button>
            <button id="mode-series" aria-pressed="false">Focused series</button>
          </div>

          <div class="compare" id="price-values">
            <div class="priceCard">
              <div class="small">Session rate</div>
              <div class="price" id="price-main">$165</div>
              <div class="sub" id="price-note">per session • telehealth</div>
            </div>
            <div class="priceCard">
              <div class="small">Subscription / package estimate</div>
              <div class="price" id="price-alt">$625</div>
              <div class="sub" id="price-sub">monthly equivalent / 4-session series</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="small" style="margin-top:10px">Rates vary by service type and format. We can discuss sliding scale or staggered scheduling when appropriate. Package options include a focused short series with defined goals.</p>
      </div>

    </section>

    <section class="panel" style="margin-top:18px">
      <h2 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">How sessions are organized</h2>
      <p class="lead">Sessions are typically 45–55 minutes. For focused work we use an agreed plan: stated aims, brief skill practice, and homework that is concrete and measurable.</p>
      <ul style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6">
        <li>Initial orienting conversation to set goals and clarify fit.</li>
        <li>Regular review points to track change and adjust approach.</li>
        <li>Short series available for a sharp, time-limited focus.</li>
      </ul>

      <div style="margin-top:12px"><a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#9fdbe6);color:#052025;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700">Arrange a conversation</a></div>

    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px;color:var(--muted)">Confidentiality, scope, and crisis note: Clinical records are kept secure. Therapy is not an emergency service; if you are in immediate danger or crisis, call local emergency services or a crisis line.</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Pricing comparator logic with animated numbers
    const modes = {
      ongoing: {main:165, alt:625, note:'per session • telehealth', sub:'monthly equivalent / 4-session series'},
      series: {main:185, alt:740, note:'per session (series rate)', sub:'4-session package total'}
    };
    let current = 'ongoing';
    const btnO = document.getElementById('mode-ongoing');
    const btnS = document.getElementById('mode-series');
    const elMain = document.getElementById('price-main');
    const elAlt = document.getElementById('price-alt');
    const elNote = document.getElementById('price-note');
    const elSub = document.getElementById('price-sub');

    function animateNumber(el, from, to, ms=600){
      const start = performance.now();
      function tick(now){
        const t = Math.min(1,(now-start)/ms);
        const val = Math.round(from + (to-from)*t);
        el.textContent = '$' + val;
        if(t<1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(tick);
    }

    function switchMode(mode){
      if(current===mode) return;
      current=mode;
      const data = modes[mode];
      btnO.classList.toggle('active', mode==='ongoing'); btnO.setAttribute('aria-pressed', mode==='ongoing');
      btnS.classList.toggle('active', mode==='series'); btnS.setAttribute('aria-pressed', mode==='series');
      const fromMain = Number(elMain.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')) || data.main;
      const fromAlt = Number(elAlt.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,'')) || data.alt;
      animateNumber(elMain, fromMain, data.main);
      animateNumber(elAlt, fromAlt, data.alt);
      elNote.textContent = data.note;
      elSub.textContent = data.sub;
    }

    btnO.addEventListener('click', ()=>switchMode('ongoing'));
    btnS.addEventListener('click', ()=>switchMode('series'));
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Approach & Process — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#07131a;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);--accent:#7ec9cf;--muted:#b7c6cc}
    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#041018,#062227);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#eaf6fb}
    header{padding:16px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    nav{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    .logo{font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-right:12px}
    main{padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    .container{max-width:980px;width:100%}
    .steps{display:flex;gap:12px}
    .step{flex:1;background:var(--glass);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03)}
    .step h4{margin:0;color:#eaf6fb}
    .step p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}

    .process{margin-top:14px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);padding:12px;border-radius:12px}

    .mini-proof{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px}
    .mini-proof .quote{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .mini-proof button{background:none;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);color:var(--muted);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}

    .fine{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:12px}

    footer{padding:18px;color:var(--muted)}

    @media(max-width:880px){.steps{flex-direction:column}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <nav>
      <div class="logo">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <a href="index.html">Start</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Services</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Rates</a>
      <a href="faq.html">Help</a>
      <a href="book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="container">
      <h1 style="margin:0">How I work — a clear, collaborative process</h1>
      <p class="fine">Clinical structure that emphasizes clarity: we name a limited set of aims, choose change experiments, and check progress at regular intervals.</p>

      <div class="steps" role="list">
        <div class="step" role="listitem">
          <h4>1. Orientation</h4>
          <p>Brief intake to identify priorities, expectations, and whether my approach fits your needs. We clarify confidentiality and scope.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step" role="listitem">
          <h4>2. Goal design</h4>
          <p>We craft specific, behaviorally-focused aims with measurable indicators of progress.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step" role="listitem">
          <h4>3. Practice & review</h4>
          <p>Sessions include skill instruction, in-session practice, and brief, concrete tasks to use between sessions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="process" aria-labelledby="process-title">
        <h3 id="process-title" style="margin:0">Typical sequence for short work</h3>
        <ol style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">
          <li>One or two orientation sessions to clarify goals and fit.</li>
          <li>Three to six focused sessions with explicit practice and measurement.</li>
          <li>End review with maintenance plan or transition to ongoing care if helpful.</li>
        </ol>

        <div class="mini-proof">
          <div class="quote">"A short series gave me a clear map and next steps I could actually use." — S.</div>
          <button id="more-proof">Show another example</button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:14px">
        <h3 style="margin:0">Clinical limits & crisis guidance</h3>
        <p class="fine">Therapy focuses on the concerns we agree upon; if care needs fall outside my scope, I will discuss referrals. This practice does not provide emergency or crisis services. If you are in immediate danger, call emergency services or your local crisis line.</p>
      </section>

      <div style="margin-top:14px"><a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#9fe5ea);padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;color:#052025;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none">Start the conversation</a></div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px;color:var(--muted)">If you have questions about fit, scope, or accessibility accommodations, please reach out at <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--muted)">{{EMAIL}}</a> or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--muted)">{{PHONE}}</a>.</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // small rotating micro-proof for this page
    (function(){
      const samples = [
        'The structure helped me see small wins and keep going — M.',
        'We set very specific, usable goals. The sessions felt efficient — J.',
        'I appreciated the steady focus and the clear homework — A.'
      ];
      let i = 0;
      const btn = document.getElementById('more-proof');
      const quoteEl = document.querySelector('.mini-proof .quote');
